meta {
  name: Get User Leaderboard
  type: http
  seq: 13
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/stats/user/leaderboard
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get User Leaderboard

  This request is used to get user leaderboard. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and have a protected routes.

  ## Responses

  **200 — stats fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "stats fetched",
    "data": {
      "user_with_most_inventory": {
        "username": "John Doe",
        "total": 15
      },
      "user_with_most_report": {
        "username": "Jane Smith",
        "total": 22
      }
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — stats failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "stats not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}